===Etymology===
[[onomatopoeia]] of the sound and rhythm of German folk music.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-oom-pah.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[oom]]-[[pah]]|-}}

# {{label|en|music genre}} A [[genre]] of Germanic music (especially Bavarian music) typically involving [[brass]] instruments.
# {{label|en|music}} A [[bass]] line characteristic of such music, a bass that alternates lower and higher [[notes]] or [[chords]] on the beat, or that alternates in a mid-high-low-high sequence.

